    "setups": [
      {"id": "A", "desc": "seated at a desk, front-on, phone or camera at eye level 70-90 cm away, low-key warm practicals behind (lamp, shelf), plain dark or earth-tone tee/hoodie, the desk surface (cutting mat, wood) visible in the bottom 15-25% for props",
